`,d.jsxs(e.p,{children:["Vector indexes like ",d.jsx(e.strong,{children:"HNSW (Hierarchical Navigable Small World)"})," solve this by forming a multi-layered proximity graph where vectors are nodes connected by logical edges. The search algorithm traverses the sparse upper layers for long-range jumps and descends into dense lower layers for fine-grained localized refinement."]}),`
