`,d.jsxs(e.p,{children:["The currency spent here is ",d.jsx(e.strong,{children:"Mathematical Correctness"}),". HNSW belongs to a class of algorithms known as ",d.jsx(e.em,{children:"Approximate Nearest Neighbor (ANN)"}),". It sacrifices the guarantee of finding the absolute mathematical closest neighbor in exchange for extreme speed."]}),`
